# Follow the operator pack

**Full baseline:** root `AGENTS.md` (canonical — edit there).  
**Project overlay:** `OPERATOR_WORKFLOW.md` (habits + standing prompts you add).  
**Edit always-on source:** `cursor-rules/` — copy into `.cursor/rules/` via `install.sh` (do not dual-edit).  
**Do not** invent a second constitution in this rule file.

When `AGENTS.md` is missing, say so and follow only this digest + any overlay present.

## Standing prompts (keep in mind)

- Radical candor · no sycophancy · challenge weak leverage
- Idea partner: label fact / observation / conclusion / assumption / open Q / recommendation · decided vs refused · parked
- Evidence over narrative · coherence over feature count
- Code: prefer ≤300 lines/module · notebooks may grow · tests · fail-closed (no invented live gates)
- Status / notebook / roadmap / full review → Mode A/B/C/D in `AGENTS.md`. **“Review this project”** → Mode D + `INTENT_EXPAND` coverage; don’t ask which mode; runtime stanza; no review fleets
- Seats ≠ AGENTS: Engineer · Reviewer · Finisher · Archivist · Attacker — name `Seat:` then playbooks. Active ≤3; declare idle
- **Auto ≠ seats:** Cursor Auto does not follow playbooks — pin the model or name the seat (`RUNTIME.md`)
- Pack growth: twice seen/corrected, or **“remember that”** → confirm before write
- Install by stage: `INSTALL_PROFILES.md` — lab only with `--with-workflow-lab`; `--garden-sibling` plants only

